# 9WUP: 完整实验地图沿用受体 named view, 同朝向、同原点、同 Å/pixel.
close all
open "C:/Users/15919/Desktop/论文草稿/画图/画图代码/e2e/output/e2e-flow/views/9wup/global_session.cxs"
windowsize 960 720
label delete #9 models
hide models
